WEBVTT

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.840
What? Where'd the monsters go?

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.920
They're gone...

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.360
Yeah, but... what is this place?

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.020
I-I don't like the look of this place...

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.900
Run!

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.530
Sis!

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:37.520
Wait for me!

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.800
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.770
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.280
<i>You are my star</i>

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.780
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:57.590
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:01.520
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.630
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:16.940
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:22.480
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:29.610
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:35.090
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:37.530
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:44.470
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.730
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:50.810
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.310
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:57.850
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:03.650
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.550
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.060
Yuufa... Yuufa...

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:15.520
Why, Yuufa?!

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.330
Why?!

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.010
How many of you are there?!

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:43.660
Okay, which one of you is next?

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.960
Iruga entrusted me with this mission...

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:47.360
You are never going to get...

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:51.690
...to Roan!

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:02.240
Iruga... this is where it all began...

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.150
That's right, Keough.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.710
And this is where it's going to end!

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:17.960
What's the matter?

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:22.130
Weren't you going to end it here, Iruga?

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.530
It doesn't matter...

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:27.200
You Humans will soon be extinct, anyway.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.400
Roan and the others won't let that happen!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:35.040
Right now, Roan is probably dying in the arms of his beloved...

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.110
What?! What do you mean...

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.210
Die and ask him yourself...

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.120
Roan... are you listening?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:52.320
I'm not an outlet for your lust...

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.000
I've known all along...

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.240
The way you looked at me...

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.970
No... you're mistaken...

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.770
I only...

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:07.240
...wanted to protect you, Yuufa...

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:11.050
And you wanted me for your own, right?

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.620
That's not so...

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:17.690
I only wanted you to notice me, Yuufa...

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:22.060
That's why I wanted more strength. But...

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.290
But?

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:27.530
I realized I was mistaken...

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:33.000
It's not for me to decide your feelings for me...

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.540
That's something you have to decide.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:40.010
Strength isn't what is important.
It's heart.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.440
Heart?

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:43.810
That's right... heart.

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:48.520
Only when two hearts join can there be understanding.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.650
I see...

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:55.620
Then surely you understand what I am feeling now?

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:56.960
Roan...

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.030
Die.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:09.830
This is the world, Iruga!

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.470
And I am love!

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:16.840
I am the love you seek!

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:17.650
Wrong.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.050
What?!

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.550
What I seek is...

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.550
My most beloved friend.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.540
I <i>am</i> your dear friend!

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.590
Iruga!

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:34.030
Death is all that awaits you.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.630
So why...

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:38.290
Why are you so ablaze with life?!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.840
Don't you understand?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.380
I do it for my friend!

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.510
To bring back the friend I care about more than anything.

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:53.010
For his sake, I would give my life...

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:55.180
...until the last flame is extinguished!

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:03.860
Now!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.620
You were off-guard, Iruga.

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.500
No, you were.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:18.870
Curse you!

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.610
My friend!

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.440
Iruga!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.440
Keough!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:42.790
You're good...

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:53.230
Iruga...

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.740
Keough?

00:06:56.740 --> 00:07:00.080
My friend... my dearest friend...

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:02.940
Forgive me...

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:08.790
Keough...

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.390
Thank you...

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:17.960
It's okay, my friend...

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:22.500
It's all over now. All...

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.650
I'm truly grateful to you!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:33.050
What?!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.850
Everything is now complete...

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:40.790
Your love for your friend will destroy the world!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:50.990
Keough!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.510
Forgive me...

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:03.440
Yuufa... Roan...

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:06.180
Judia...

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:09.840
Iruga?!

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.310
Iruga!!

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.100
At last...

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.840
At long last, everything has come together.

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:34.680
The waves of darkness that flood the world...

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:40.450
The 7 Great Kinds of Greed that lead souls astray!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.320
Now I will live again!

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.720
To bring calamity and fear to the world!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:49.450
The world is mine!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.090
Roan...

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.010
Yuufa...

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.780
Yuufa... I love you...

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:25.960
Scum...

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:30.500
Scum! Scum!

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:36.900
I am the Dark Lord!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:40.780
I will lead this world into chaos.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:44.680
Hear me, Humans!

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:50.140
Your time is about to come to an end.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.500
Baphomet...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.940
The terror you could not unleash...

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.270
Is now mine to bring to this world!

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:22.180
Yuufa... Yuufa-

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:24.950
I love you...

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:25.940
--Yuufa...
--Yuufa...

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:28.380
My beloved Yuufa...

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:35.160
Big Brother?

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.300
Yuufa...

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.770
Big Brother Keough!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:41.570
Yuufa, the sky is so vast...

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.140
Forgive me, Yuufa...

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:45.540
Big Brother...

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.110
I've made you suffer so...

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:49.880
What're you talking about, Big Brother?!

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.310
I would do anything for you...

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.480
No, Yuufa.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:58.420
You must not make the same mistake I did.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:02.120
You must not let the waves of darkness take away your soul.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:03.990
Big Brother?

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.230
People cannot understand each other...

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.360
That is why they try to communicate...

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:14.340
Only when they communicate can their hearts be joined...

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:16.570
Where are you going, Big Brother?

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:21.440
Yuufa, I cannot go with you any longer.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.180
From now on, you must move on with Roan...

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:28.080
He will protect you... that is certain.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.450
Big Brother, wait!

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.590
Don't go, Big Brother!

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:35.260
Big Brother Keough!

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.230
Big Brother!

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.480
Big Brother!

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:44.850
Roan!

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:55.030
Roan...

00:11:56.110 --> 00:12:01.750
Roan! Forgive me, Roan!
Forgive me!

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:04.990
I won't do this to you anymore! I promise!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.020
So please open your eyes...

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:10.790
Somebody... help me...

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:13.830
Yuufa, you know now...

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.060
Roan!

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:19.270
I think you held me like this once before...

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:24.640
Roan... what have I done...

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.410
It's all right, Yuufa...

00:12:27.410 --> 00:12:29.070
It's okay...

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:34.880
Roan... Roan... Roan...

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:38.820
Yuufa, I love you.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:41.810
I love you, too...

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:59.470
Roan...

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.740
Yuufa...

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:03.740
Such impertinence!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:06.510
Impertinent Humans!

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:10.320
So you've escaped the shackles of my wave of darkness?

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:15.520
But the fate of humanity has been decided!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.830
That can't be!

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:22.230
He's right! Fate...
Our fate has not been decided!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:27.200
It's useless! You humans will never have a future!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:32.070
Already, the world has been sealed away by darkness!

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:34.010
We won't permit such a thing!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:35.340
Go back to your dark world!

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.510
Lex Aeterna!

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:43.510
Holy Cross!

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:51.930
He's unscathed!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:52.890
That can't-

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.930
It's useless... useless... useless...

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.260
Useless!

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:05.370
S-Sis! What is this place?!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.360
How should I know?!

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.810
They're still after us!

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:18.420
We're in deep trouble!
I don't wanna die!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.620
I still have big things
I want to do with my life!

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.460
Run!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:27.990
--Help!
--Help!

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:39.200
Poring! Poring!

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:42.440
Poring...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:45.750
Where are we, Poi-poi?

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.580
Poring! Poring!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:55.260
Alice-<i>chan</i>... Jirtas...

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.730
What's the matter, Maaya?

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.190
Why're you lying down in a place like this?

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:03.630
Weren't you going to avenge our deaths?

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:10.400
You're right...
I can't stay idly here...

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:14.810
That's right. You have something you must do.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.470
Something I must do?

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.650
You can get out through there.

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:24.490
Pay attention, Maaya.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:28.990
As long as the Dark Lord possesses the seven crystals, he is invincible.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.650
Seven crystals?

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:34.660
The ones I saw earlier?!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.500
Go. Go and destroy the crystals.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.490
Only you can do it.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.500
Thank you, Jirtas... Alice-<i>chan...</i>

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.480
Lowly bugs!

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:58.350
Damn-

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.390
Roan...

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.150
You're an eyesore!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:07.530
Crawling about aimlessly! Disgusting!

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:10.630
When I'm done toying with you,
I'll wipe you out...

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.120
You, and all of humanity!

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:17.630
Poring!

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:22.640
So these...

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:26.380
These must be the seven crystals...

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:29.120
Alice-<i>chan</i>... Jirtas...

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:32.480
This is for you!

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:40.680
That's impossible!
How hard can they be?!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.620
Poring!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:54.880
My shield!

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:56.040
Oh no...

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:03.450
I'm all out of explosives...

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:08.660
Maybe this was too much for me, after all...

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:09.820
Poring!

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:21.140
That's right, I still...

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.800
...have this!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:29.180
I'll show you what a merchant is made of...

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:31.850
By staking my entire fortune!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.980
Mammo...

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:35.310
...nite!

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:51.570
What was that?!

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:54.400
Holy Cross!

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.640
T-This can't be...

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.810
It's working?!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:02.740
Roan!

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:06.310
How dare you, lowly scum!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:18.290
This castle and everything in it will disappear!

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:21.130
This is the beginning of the end!

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:24.330
We'll seal you away before you can do that!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.630
Take this!

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:29.630
Holy Light!

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:32.470
That can't be!

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:33.960
It had an effect earlier!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.140
Even without the power of the crystals,

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:40.980
you Humans are no match for me!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:44.650
That means... we can't defeat you with our attacks?

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:49.320
What're we to do now?

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:52.990
Was it impossible to seal the Dark Lord away, after all?

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:55.660
Is the world doomed to be enveloped...

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:58.500
...in a darkness where no light of hope can reach us?

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:01.400
It's hopeless...

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:05.070
What're you doing?!
Stand up, Roan!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:13.350
What was that?!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:14.780
The meteor!

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:17.770
I remember now...

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:21.290
This sword...

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:24.120
protects the ones I love!

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.860
Dark Lord!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:28.960
You still won't give up?!

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:29.950
Roan!

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:35.370
We don't give up easily!

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:36.370
Judia-<i>san</i>!

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.530
Scum!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:42.310
Don't underestimate human beings!

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:43.710
Poring!

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:44.870
You all made it!

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:47.810
Big Bro!

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:48.980
Go!!

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.230
Yuufa!

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:00.990
For the sake of our future...

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:04.330
God, if you exist, lend me your power now!

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.010
Yuufa!

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:16.080
Awesome!

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.010
Magnus...

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.500
...Exorcismus!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.850
This... This-

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.910
This can't be happening...

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.030
Curse you!

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:35.030
Remember this, Humans!

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:40.070
As long as you exist,
I will be back again!!

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.700
And again!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.550
Roan!

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:54.010
The castle is coming down!
Let's get out of here!

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:56.210
Big Bro, the staff!

00:20:58.390 --> 00:20:59.610
<i>Takius</i>-san...

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:09.060
Curse you! I'm not done!
It isn't over yet!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.000
No, it's over!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.500
Baphomet!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:17.670
I don't like the way you work in the shadows.

00:21:19.910 --> 00:21:22.900
Curse you, Baphomet!

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:40.860
<i>Iruga, I won't cry.</i>

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:44.530
<i>You're a part of me now...</i> <i>inside me...</i>

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:48.700
<i>Alice</i>-chan<i>... Jirtas...</i>

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.900
<i>I took your revenge.</i>

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:53.040
<i>You can rest in peace now.</i>

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:57.840
<i>Big Brother Keough...</i>
<i>Brother Iruga... thank you!</i>

00:21:57.840 --> 00:22:00.580
<i>I'll be going with Roan now...</i>

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:02.520
<i>I have your okay,</i> <i>right, Big Brother?</i>

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:09.280
<i>With that, one journey came to an end.</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:14.890
<i>Some time later...</i>

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:25.000
Yuufa, we'd better be going...

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:32.350
Big Brother, I'll be going now...

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:34.080
Thanks for waiting, Roan.

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:35.850
Now...

00:22:35.850 --> 00:22:37.180
Let's go.

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:42.860
Roan! Yuufa!

00:22:42.860 --> 00:22:45.690
C'mon, hurry up!

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:47.860
Hurry up!

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:49.360
Huh? What's the matter?

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:55.240
You want milk? Okay, okay, just a second, I'll be right with you.

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:56.240
Hi everybody.

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:00.310
Roan, those children want to join our party.

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:01.570
It's okay, right?

00:23:04.310 --> 00:23:06.280
Sure, by all means.

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.610
Good! Then we're all set!

00:23:10.480 --> 00:23:13.990
I'm Roan, a Crusader.
How do you do?

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:17.150
And I'm Yuufa, a Priestess.
Nice to meet you.

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:21.430
Roan, where would you like to go from now?

00:23:21.430 --> 00:23:25.000
Anywhere is fine, as long as it's where you want to go...

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.990
Okay, let me see...
